morning|PASS: Early-day period is stated approximately, not as an absolute clock boundary; harbour-sketching example and in/on/this morning patterns are coherent.
rock|PASS: Back-and-forth verb, mineral material/piece noun and music noun are distinct; boat, blocked path and band examples match their translations and countability.
today|PASS: Arrived-today adverb and today's-programme noun construction differ syntactically; both refer to the speaker's current day without assigning permanent dates.
writer|PASS: Creator of written work is accurate beyond novels; resident interviews and novel context match Vietnamese nhà văn and no source biography is fabricated.
